sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer / PR Bot
    participant OPA as OPA Policy Engine (P26)
    participant DAG as Temporal DAGEngine (P2 & P15)
    participant Sec as SecretsBroker (P13)
    participant GR as GateRunner / MicroVM (P3 & P10)
    participant SLSA as SLSA Authority (P11)
    participant Canary as CanaryRolloutController (P18)

    Dev->>OPA: Submit DAGBlueprint & Check SSO + RBAC
    OPA-->>DAG: Authorized (Start 24h/48h Approval Timer)
    Dev->>DAG: Human Approve Signal (UI / CLI)
    DAG->>Sec: Issue Short-Lived Scoped Token (TTL <= 15m)
    Sec-->>GR: Ephemeral Lease Bound to Job
    GR->>GR: Run L0, L1a, L3 inside MicroVM + eBPF Auditor

    alt All Authoritative Gates PASS
        GR-->>DAG: PASS Verdicts
        GR->>Sec: Revoke Lease & Destroy Sandbox in finally
        DAG->>SLSA: Sign Canonical SLSA v1.0 Provenance (Ed25519)
        SLSA-->>Canary: Verified Signature + Human Release Approval
        Canary->>Canary: Shift Traffic 5% -> 25% -> 50% -> 100%
    else Authoritative Gate FAIL
        GR-->>DAG: FAIL Verdict (No Retry on Deterministic Fault)
        GR->>Sec: Revoke Lease & Destroy Sandbox in finally
        DAG->>DAG: Cancel Downstream Dependent Nodes
    end
